(x1, x2, ... ) + (y1, y2, ... ) = (x1 + y1, x2 + y2, ... ),
λ(x1, x2, ... ) = (λx1, λx2, ... ).
With these definitions, F∞ becomes a vector space over F, as you should verify. The additive identity in this vector space is the sequence of all 0’s.
